          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹುಡುಗ (huḍuga) is native Dravidian (DEDR 4259). DEDR lists huḍuga, \"boy, child\", beside puṭṭa, \"small\". DEDR 4259 compares Sanskrit puṭṭ."
